                            <comment id="15259975" author="sboikov" created="Wed, 27 Apr 2016 11:09:34 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Valentin,&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;I reviewed your changes, for &apos;get&apos; inside serializable transactions we need to check that entry version did not change when tx is comitted, so &apos;fast finish&apos;  path can not be used. I fixed this and also added sanity test for &apos;fast finish&apos; txs.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
